Privacy Policy

Last updated: January 2026

This application (“the App”) is developed to provide its intended functionality and respects the privacy of its users.

Information Collection and Use

The App may request access to the device camera exclusively to allow the user to take photos within the application.

Photos are used only for the app’s functionality

The App does not collect personal data automatically

The App does not share data with third parties

Camera Permission

The camera permission (android.permission.CAMERA) is required solely to:

Capture photos initiated by the user

The App does not access the camera in the background and does not record video or audio without user interaction.

Data Storage

Images captured may be stored locally on the device

The App does not upload images to external servers unless explicitly stated within the app

Data Security

Reasonable measures are taken to protect the information handled by the App. However, no method of storage is 100% secure.

Children’s Privacy

The App does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

This policy may be updated from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page.

Contact

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you may contact the developer through the application’s store listing.
